Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:03.92,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Zinger, Pineapple, Host, Marcus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(110,602)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:04.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\pos(112,666)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:06.29,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:09.09,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.23,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,6 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:13.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.09,0:01:18.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,In the tactics section "Notes on weapons and equipment"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:21.20,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,says if there are fewer allies than enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:23.27,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,we need to resort to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.27,0:01:27.77,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,If you are unable to defend, retreat and...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:31.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What a strange woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.05,0:01:34.11,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you won’t believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.11,0:01:36.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Behaves extremely unusually.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:41.99,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How long can you dance to the ancient music of your ancestors?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.99,0:01:43.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:47.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,served in special forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.86,0:01:50.30,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-He talks so arrogantly.\N-Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:51.97,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And you probably imagine yourself to be a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:53.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I am the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.91,0:02:00.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.75,0:02:07.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Forget it, I don’t care.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:09.08,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:11.85,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And behaves like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:22.90,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And sometimes as if she were Buddha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.90,0:02:28.84,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Please, do not touch those who are innocent of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:30.97,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,But she is angry as if evil spirits have possessed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.97,0:02:33.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Anyone in my place would be angry right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:35.21,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,if he weren't Buddha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.21,0:02:37.71,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Sometimes she is the very embodiment of humanity,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:40.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and I don’t understand what’s on\N this mysterious woman’s mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.65,0:02:44.95,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The moment is lost. There's no point in saying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:47.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Is there really no point?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:51.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Am I so difficult to explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.69,0:02:56.83,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-What did you say?\N-You didn’t listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.83,0:02:58.80,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What were you thinking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:03:01.50,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,have you forgotten about your favorite book?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:05.41,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Must be about Mrs. Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:08.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:09.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,No need to pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.91,0:03:14.82,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It’s clear from your eyes that you were thinking about the woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:16.72,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I was thinking about the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:17.72,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.72,0:03:20.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,So stop embarrassing\Nme with your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:22.96,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The Queen is also a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:25.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,but I never thought of her that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.49,0:03:28.33,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You'll never guess what's on her mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:31.13,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,no wonder you're interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:35.60,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The Queen is the most unusual and strange person
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:38.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,out of everyone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:43.44,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,As if she is not from our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:49.35,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And best describes our queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:57.12,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,A word that directly says\Nthat a person is not of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:58.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.06,0:04:01.33,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Alien?\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.63,0:04:06.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Perfect for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:09.84,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:16.81,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Has the rain finally stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.81,0:04:19.15,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It was raining all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:21.55,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I hope no one got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.55,0:04:23.45,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.82,0:04:25.85,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I’m uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:31.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How long are you going to talk so strangely?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:34.33,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Today only. This is the last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:39.53,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,And tomorrow everything will fall into place! Oh yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:46.54,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It can’t be!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:56.88,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.93,0:05:08.03,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Open the gate! King's order!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:10.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Open the gate!\N-Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:34.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I shouldn’t have gotten here\NJang Bong-hwan
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:11.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:13.42,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Oh damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:14.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:16.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,He recently tried to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:18.13,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I have to ask you the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:20.26,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I can’t believe\Nthat you tried to commit suicide again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.26,0:07:22.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:24.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What do you care if I'm alive or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:27.13,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Didn’t you want me to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:33.24,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Don’t bother me! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.91,0:07:37.34,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It’s not too late to resolve all misunderstandings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:40.38,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Let's live the way you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:43.12,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Social distancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.85,0:07:50.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Correct! Social distancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:53.93,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-No way!\N-Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:55.83,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What are you doing! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:57.50,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:01.77,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,She said that you want to keep your distance,\Nand are you trying to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.87,0:08:04.54,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Weren’t you trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:05.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,So why the hell are you touching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.91,0:08:07.74,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I understand why you're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:11.64,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I committed a great sin and now\Nin an unpaid debt to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:15.85,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I understand, it sounds like an excuse,\Nbut we just misunderstood each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:19.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I don’t care how we understood each other there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:21.05,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Please listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:23.56,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I don’t want to listen to you pouring water into my ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.69,0:08:25.79,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Out of the way!\N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:27.49,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I agree to distancing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.49,0:08:29.96,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I will never leave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:34.60,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Do you even understand what distancing means?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.60,0:08:36.20,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:40.17,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I remember everything you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:42.34,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Social distancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:45.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Live in peace and harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:48.95,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Live, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:51.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,But you forgot the most important thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:52.69,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Everyone for themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:54.86,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Live as you want,\Nand I will live my own way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.72,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The main thing in all this is not to live,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:59.53,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and the fact that everyone is for himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:02.13,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I will do everything to follow this rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:04.93,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I will try my best to make sure we both are happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.93,0:09:07.97,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Forget about it!\NForget about fucking distancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.97,0:09:09.14,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:12.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You and I put different meanings into this phrase!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.51,0:09:15.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Such a small thing, but already two different meanings!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:17.01,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,We think alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.01,0:09:19.25,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'll prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:22.15,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I suggest adhering to social distancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:24.65,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I won’t stick to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.65,0:09:27.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Let's try to live by this rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:29.66,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Infuriating!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.33,0:09:43.87,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,6 episode: Between understanding and misunderstanding
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.51,0:09:47.61,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:51.81,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.81,0:09:53.51,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Call the chief eunuch now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:57.72,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I'm fine, take care of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:00.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-Yes, Your Majesty.\N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:03.19,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Oh, our poor you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:05.76,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:17.34,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I shouldn’t have gotten here\NJang Bong-hwan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:19.10,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.37,0:11:21.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I missed you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.90,0:11:25.94,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Are you in the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:28.31,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:36.25,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I see you are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:38.72,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,How did you sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:40.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:44.09,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,today is your first day in the palace,\Nso I got up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:47.89,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I will try my best
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:49.66,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,and I will not disgrace the name of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:52.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It’s good that the rain has stopped,\Nthe road to the palace will be much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:54.40,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Finish getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:56.07,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:20.03,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I almost choked,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:23.03,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,honestly, if it weren't for Cheoljong,\NI would already be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:25.50,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Why didn’t this devil come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:34.27,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What happened between you and the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:36.68,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Why were you at the lake at such an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.81,0:12:42.08,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Are you still not finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:45.42,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I wiped everything off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:54.39,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,When did you manage to escape?\NI was watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:12:58.80,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Did you jump into the water again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:01.77,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It’s not like that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:07.54,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I brought a change of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.54,0:13:09.44,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Why are you so wet then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.44,0:13:13.21,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Yes. I was glad that the lake was filled again,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:16.18,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,so I decided to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.68,0:13:18.22,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:20.45,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Were you two swimming?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.55,0:13:22.52,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,You shouldn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:25.56,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,What if you get sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:31.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Looks like the lake won't help me get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:33.73,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Some kind of nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:45.71,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.11,0:13:47.38,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:49.62,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.92,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,where were you in such a hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:54.72,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Why are you soaking wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.72,0:13:57.29,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,-It’s okay.\N-How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:47.61,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I owe you a huge debt,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:50.78,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,so I will live to help you, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:02.16,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't notice you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.16,0:15:04.69,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Are you sure you didn’t see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:21.11,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,When the small fry knows too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:22.98,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,only death awaits her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:27.85,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This is the rule of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:31.05,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I must survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.12,0:15:34.82,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Lady Hwajin told me to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:04.88,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Today at dawn the queen fell into the lake again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:09.32,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,But this time the king was with her...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.72,0:16:14.56,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,No one seems to know why they both ended up in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.63,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,That's enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.63,0:16:22.30,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,to prove that I will be useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.20,0:16:25.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Tell this to the Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.24,0:16:30.14,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Should I describe everything exactly as it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:32.38,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,After you talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:34.95,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,tell me everything you say or do
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.95,0:16:37.18,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,queen mother, any little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:42.25,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,It’s not up to you to decide what might be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:44.29,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,I will do exactly as you ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:48.03,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,From this day on, you obey the lady of the court
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:51.00,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,queen's chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:55.50,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Queen's chambers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:58.30,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,This is a very high position!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.34,0:16:59.91,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:03.54,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother will decide that you will be much more useful to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:07.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Carefully monitor the queen’s surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:10.75,Default,pineapple,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.66,0:17:23.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Draw a flower
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:25.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,or bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:28.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What do you think, Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:36.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Except His Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.48,0:17:38.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I have no one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.48,0:17:45.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Highness, the Queen Mother is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:51.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Greetings, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.72,0:17:54.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You drew orchids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.57,0:18:02.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are they finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:03.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:07.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I haven’t decided whether to draw a flower or an unopened bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:09.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.91,0:18:13.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I think the bud will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:16.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Everyone will be interested,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.65,0:18:21.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,what flower will it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:42.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,God, what a beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.04,0:18:44.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I hope the buds don’t fly around,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:48.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,before it blooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:51.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.12,0:18:54.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I came to give you a small gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.40,0:19:08.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.70,0:19:10.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I didn’t know what you liked,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.24,0:19:12.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I had to think for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:25.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I heard that you are an excellent archer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:28.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I also want to learn how to shoot a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.99,0:19:31.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I prepared it for myself and for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:37.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Beautiful and durable arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.17,0:19:40.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:43.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The real gift is not arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:47.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The gift will be delivered today
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:50.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,To His Majesty at the court meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:19:59.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Where if not in the lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:02.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Only water unites us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:09.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:12.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We were both on the verge of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:15.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Damn, what if I try and really die?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:17.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Dying hurts so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:22.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm sure there is a safe way to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:25.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,First of all, I’ll understand what kind of woman this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.35,0:20:32.38,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I am Kim So-yeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.29,0:20:35.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:40.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Leave your false self?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.89,0:20:45.03,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why did you try to die? I didn't want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.23,0:20:50.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course, that's why she doesn't want to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.34,0:20:53.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This woman... She ran away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:21:00.21,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I understand why you are doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.21,0:21:02.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You are obsessed with the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.32,0:21:04.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and mutter to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.75,0:21:06.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It's because you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.19,0:21:12.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,trying to bring back memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:16.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:18.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:20.70,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,A question has arisen. When I fell into the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:23.47,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I was immediately pulled out, but I was unconscious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.04,0:21:25.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.57,0:21:27.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Damn. I knew it. She ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:30.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:32.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I want to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:35.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is a kidnapping!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.65,0:21:39.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Roasted dorosoma brings back runaway wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:42.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Or summon spirits that have left the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:44.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Rite?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:48.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes. I have to perform the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.43,0:21:50.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I’ll cover everything here with expensive talismans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.60,0:21:54.03,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.27,0:22:02.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is there a specialist in rituals or talismans here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:04.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.51,0:22:07.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You should not be interested in shamanism,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.11,0:22:10.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,but you will do it anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:16.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,One person comes to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.19,0:22:18.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And who?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.63,0:22:31.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why did she come here? What does he want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.20,0:22:34.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,To what do I owe this pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.24,0:22:37.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I learned that you are an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.54,0:22:40.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Me? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.11,0:22:44.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I need a spiritual guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.65,0:22:48.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,In matters such as rituals and talismans.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:51.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Did you really guess that I have a new talisman,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.59,0:22:53.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,cursing her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.03,0:22:57.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Come on, this is bad taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.13,0:23:00.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why do you need this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:02.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yeah, that’s nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.10,0:23:06.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You need to summon the spirit that has left the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.44,0:23:09.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Does this happen often?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:12.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She is cleverly trying to get closer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.98,0:23:15.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Wants to punish me for my talismans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.98,0:23:18.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Sly fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.55,0:23:21.62,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I don’t believe in such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.62,0:23:24.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Neither ghosts nor spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.19,0:23:30.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Then what is this here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.50,0:23:39.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.17,0:23:41.47,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is not a shamanic place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.47,0:23:44.21,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Here I cleanse my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.21,0:23:46.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.38,0:23:50.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.25,0:23:51.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.72,0:23:57.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Whose spirit do you want to summon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.86,0:24:03.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I can say that we are close and closely connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.63,0:24:06.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is a woman, don’t get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.20,0:24:07.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.37,0:24:12.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Probably this is your mother,\Nwhom you have never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.24,0:24:18.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,God. My heart is breaking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.61,0:24:20.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You must be lonely in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.61,0:24:23.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You miss your late mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.32,0:24:25.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Because of this
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.35,0:24:28.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,tried to commit suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.16,0:24:31.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.86,0:24:34.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You can tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.96,0:24:37.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Although I did not give birth to a king,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.33,0:24:41.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,but according to the pedigree, I am his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.00,0:24:46.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,From this day on, I will cherish you as my daughter and take care...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.97,0:24:49.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I already have two mothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.31,0:24:53.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,To be honest, I wasn't trying to kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.71,0:24:57.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Then why did you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.38,0:24:59.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And I’m talking about the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.05,0:25:01.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why on earth did I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.32,0:25:03.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Do you want me to guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.39,0:25:07.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So she has an ulterior motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.33,0:25:13.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So she threatens me and wants me to be on my guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.94,0:25:22.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Damn. Wasted my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.31,0:25:26.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The court meeting has not yet taken place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.71,0:25:30.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And she’s already trying to threaten me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.92,0:25:34.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Court lady Han, they also have
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.19,0:25:36.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,a bird that brings rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.96,0:25:40.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What? Who could have done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.59,0:25:45.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She boldly burst in and dropped hints,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.47,0:25:50.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,so it’s not that easy to figure out the bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.67,0:25:54.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Contact the fortune teller, court lady Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.34,0:25:59.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I need predictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.65,0:26:05.25,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She was tormented by something and tried to kill herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.25,0:26:06.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But she couldn’t die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.95,0:26:09.05,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,And her soul is like: “Don’t care. I’m going out.”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.22,0:26:12.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And did not return.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.99,0:26:14.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What was tormenting her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.69,0:26:17.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She didn’t want to become queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.10,0:26:18.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.23,0:26:22.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Because Cheoljong didn’t love her
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.00,0:26:24.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and fell in love with someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.57,0:26:26.14,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.14,0:26:28.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Tried to die because of a moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.21,0:26:33.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Her Majesty talks to herself more than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.35,0:26:34.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Many people hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.91,0:26:36.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,That's the least of my problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.82,0:26:40.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I nag her about this, but it's time to let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.19,0:26:43.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,At this rate, she'll soon kill someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.06,0:26:47.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But again, I understand her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.59,0:26:50.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Being a queen is like sitting in a prison without bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.66,0:26:53.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,From a noble family, chosen to become queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.80,0:26:56.24,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,which means she hasn’t met anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.24,0:26:59.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Perhaps I had never seen the guy before Cheoljong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.24,0:27:01.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Considering that he's a king and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.77,0:27:04.24,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,it’s clear why she fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.81,0:27:10.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. She must be having a lot of fun right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.15,0:27:12.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,All my life leading an ascetic lifestyle,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.52,0:27:15.29,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,discovered a new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.92,0:27:19.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And if this woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.69,0:27:23.56,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Let him not play with my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.44,0:27:39.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.86,0:27:57.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.76,0:28:00.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Come back quickly, we'll teach you a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.80,0:28:02.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don’t you want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.37,0:28:05.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What is so interesting you are looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.34,0:28:08.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Then I will
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.14,0:28:11.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,cut your body. Until I bleed!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.84,0:28:13.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This will be very painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.31,0:28:18.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Do you think I can’t? I can do it. Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.22,0:28:26.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Damn, it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.70,0:28:32.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There will definitely be blood this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:38.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.27,0:28:41.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It really hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.51,0:28:43.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-It hurts a lot.\N-Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.58,0:28:46.55,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.55,0:28:49.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-God.\N-The cup of patience is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.28,0:28:54.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Will come back, won’t come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.39,0:28:55.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.69,0:28:59.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Won’t return.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.73,0:29:05.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,More?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.93,0:29:07.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.77,0:29:10.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Will return when the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.34,0:29:14.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,By then I will already...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.35,0:29:23.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I call upon the spirit. Spirit come.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.58,0:29:25.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.92,0:29:30.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Summoning the spirit. Spirit come.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.82,0:29:32.99,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.79,0:29:37.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Since we have each other’s bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.23,0:29:40.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,let's talk frankly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.57,0:29:45.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Talking to yourself again?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.67,0:29:49.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Consider this a self-exorcism
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.78,0:29:51.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,or talking to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.61,0:29:53.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What if rumors start spreading?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.48,0:29:56.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,In the palace they quickly scatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.28,0:29:58.78,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What is this? Looks beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.78,0:30:01.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,His Majesty gave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.49,0:30:03.29,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,And I brought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.93,0:30:14.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Book of Changes
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.63,0:30:17.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,There's something inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.00,0:30:19.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Social distancing
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.07,0:30:22.57,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,God! So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.18,0:30:25.21,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm done with this distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.21,0:30:28.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I offered him, he refused. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.12,0:30:36.05,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Have you caught a cold yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.05,0:30:37.66,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I knew it would be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.66,0:30:40.39,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You got wet in the rain and were still playing in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.39,0:30:43.19,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.30,0:30:46.97,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Honyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.20,0:30:50.10,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,It's not a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.10,0:30:51.40,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What then?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.40,0:30:53.27,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.87,0:30:57.11,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,hopelessness itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.94,0:31:00.98,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I thought that everything would get better when the lake was filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.35,0:31:05.72,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,But you see, hope is a cruel thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.99,0:31:10.26,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,To regain your memory, you are even ready to go to shamans.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.82,0:31:13.96,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I hope you stop trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.09,0:31:16.46,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,If everything was fine with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.46,0:31:19.20,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,you wouldn't try to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.60,0:31:21.20,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,For your happiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.20,0:31:22.77,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,maybe it's better not to try to return...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.77,0:31:25.87,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,No! I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.21,0:31:29.87,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I can’t live like this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.01,0:31:35.01,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I'll tell the royal chef to prepare something for the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:37.25,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You need to eat and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.68,0:31:40.52,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,No, this woman
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.52,0:31:44.36,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,she will want to come back. I give you my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.19,0:31:50.40,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Here, blow your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.40,0:31:53.43,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I’m not a child, I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.37,0:31:59.27,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.51,0:32:06.38,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,-Eunuch Chha.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.91,0:32:12.62,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you have a cold. Please return to your chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.62,0:32:14.82,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,No, it's not a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.82,0:32:16.79,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.79,0:32:22.96,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I think it's a cold. You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.53,0:32:25.83,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Has there been any news from the Daejojeon hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.83,0:32:28.93,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,-No.\N-Did she get the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.93,0:32:30.97,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Yes, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.60,0:32:35.07,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Opening a heart that is closed is, of course, not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.07,0:32:37.61,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.61,0:32:40.28,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Get me something valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.48,0:32:45.02,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,By “something valuable” you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.55,0:32:49.32,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What are you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.59,0:32:56.70,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,We appoint Kim Byungin
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.70,0:32:59.36,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,head of the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.46,0:33:01.33,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Successful work.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.43,0:33:05.00,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.58,0:33:15.55,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I heard that you are the youngest to pass the state exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.55,0:33:17.75,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,also strong in martial arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.38,0:33:20.49,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,But despite this,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.49,0:33:22.35,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,you refused a post in the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.35,0:33:24.96,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,which caused general confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.96,0:33:28.76,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What made you change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.73,0:33:31.80,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,"Save the country in difficult times."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.80,0:33:34.63,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,In this difficult time I want to help
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.63,0:33:37.37,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,with the restoration of order in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.47,0:33:43.31,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Hard time?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.58,0:33:46.61,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,How come, apparently, the ministers hid this from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.61,0:33:48.15,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,so I don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.15,0:33:51.08,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Who is this? Qing or Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.08,0:33:54.22,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Difficulties within the country
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.25,0:33:56.89,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,much more dangerous than external threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.29,0:34:02.33,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,We suddenly have difficulties within the country?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.33,0:34:04.56,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,This means...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.01,0:34:17.88,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I caught a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.88,0:34:22.65,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,A wise king should know how to take care of his health.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.09,0:34:29.79,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.89,0:34:36.33,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You need to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.33,0:34:38.20,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,and then relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.20,0:34:41.20,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I don’t want to, I’ll sit here until I’m completely sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.20,0:34:42.80,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Let the body suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.10,0:34:44.50,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Still not my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.50,0:34:47.54,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Let him be cold and hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.54,0:34:50.64,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I still want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.48,0:34:56.92,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.92,0:34:59.68,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,torturing your body will not bring back your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.68,0:35:01.79,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You'll only hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.79,0:35:04.36,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You say that this is not your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.36,0:35:07.19,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,but it’s yours, even though you don’t remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.19,0:35:10.53,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Who will suffer? You, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.30,0:35:13.13,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Even without memories
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.13,0:35:15.70,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,you will definitely be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.70,0:35:19.40,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Look at the sky. What good weather today!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.38,0:35:26.91,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Yes. There is no dust in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.12,0:35:33.69,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,The breeze carries the smell of fresh manure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.52,0:35:36.92,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Korean food three times a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.92,0:35:39.46,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,How can you not be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.46,0:35:41.73,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm definitely happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.73,0:35:44.73,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.57,0:35:50.50,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.50,0:35:53.57,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,No, I’m not crying. I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.71,0:35:54.97,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,As you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.97,0:35:57.68,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I will try to live a happy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.34,0:36:02.41,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Are you so sad about the lack of memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.09,0:36:11.12,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,We are concerned about the queen’s condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.12,0:36:13.93,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Therefore, we ask you to consider
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.93,0:36:16.23,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,our message.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.23,0:36:17.80,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.80,0:36:20.73,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Have you discussed the overthrow of the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.30,0:36:22.73,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,-What?\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.73,0:36:26.64,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,The Queen does not give up trying to commit suicide,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.64,0:36:30.01,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,and we need to strengthen the position of the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.21,0:36:34.35,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Consider deposing the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.88,0:36:39.25,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,The Queen lied to protect
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.25,0:36:41.72,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,concubine Cho.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.72,0:36:44.29,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,After falling into the lake, she lost her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.29,0:36:46.29,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,She considers herself someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.29,0:36:48.63,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,And at the sight of water he tries to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.63,0:36:50.63,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Rumors have already spread!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.63,0:36:52.80,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,According to rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.80,0:36:54.77,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,then the words that Concubine Cho
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.77,0:36:57.80,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,pushed the queen, must also be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.80,0:36:59.07,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.07,0:37:01.21,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,-How dare?-You.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.41,0:37:03.47,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.58,0:37:08.98,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I will reject the request for violating the serving order.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.98,0:37:11.35,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You must go with him to Seungjeongwon first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.35,0:37:14.42,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,However, I am like the husband of a queen
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.42,0:37:16.69,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,and the person closest to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.69,0:37:20.66,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I say that her mind is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.33,0:37:24.96,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,-And yet...\N-We need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.96,0:37:28.73,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Let us end today's meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.34,0:37:32.07,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.10,0:37:34.71,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.51,0:37:40.31,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.31,0:37:42.61,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Heard that you are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.98,0:37:47.02,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Have you heard the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.17,0:37:50.47,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,The King is Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.29,0:37:52.92,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.06,0:37:57.33,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You are already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.33,0:37:59.46,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Only you are late here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.46,0:38:01.67,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I thought it seemed to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.67,0:38:03.07,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,but the head of the Detective Department
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.07,0:38:05.10,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,really not happy with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.97,0:38:07.01,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Head of the Detective Department?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.01,0:38:10.41,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You turned your back on the queen and humiliated her,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.41,0:38:13.41,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,who saved your beloved.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.51,0:38:17.21,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I can imagine how you treated the queen all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.58,0:38:20.22,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Perhaps that’s why she tried to commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.65,0:38:24.39,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Don’t look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.82,0:38:26.99,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,The Queen is in a quandary,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.99,0:38:29.43,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,because I tried to save your concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.43,0:38:31.76,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,-What will you do?\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.76,0:38:34.30,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I'll help her deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.30,0:38:38.30,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,How? What can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.51,0:38:43.21,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You are asking now
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.21,0:38:45.68,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,like the queen's brother
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.68,0:38:48.28,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,or as the adopted son of Kim Jwageun?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.28,0:38:51.05,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You do not have the strength to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.05,0:38:53.72,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I say what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.52,0:38:56.39,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,No power?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.86,0:39:00.62,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.23,0:39:05.30,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,However, I don’t need strength against the strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.30,0:39:08.40,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,There is a more peaceful way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.50,0:39:11.40,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I just need to be obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.40,0:39:13.70,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,To protect the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.44,0:39:16.67,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I will be obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.91,0:39:18.88,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,There is no need for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.88,0:39:21.61,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I will protect the queen myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.98,0:39:27.02,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I will stop the strong with more force.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.83,0:39:37.30,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.30,0:39:39.00,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.00,0:39:40.40,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I see this is my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.40,0:39:41.83,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Why do you have to quarrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.83,0:39:44.87,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What happened? What's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.87,0:39:48.17,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I have received a message about your overthrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.47,0:39:52.54,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,How so? I just decided to love this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.54,0:39:53.75,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,They wanted to kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.75,0:39:55.95,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,and now everyone is eager to overthrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.05,0:39:58.42,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Someone wanted to overthrow you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.88,0:40:01.35,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,The Queen Dowager was angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.02,0:40:04.49,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I'll talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.82,0:40:07.06,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Actually, I know how to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.16,0:40:11.83,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,How come, apparently you also caught a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.17,0:40:17.90,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.00,0:40:20.84,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Even though it’s urgent,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.84,0:40:23.97,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,you need to go back and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:28.48,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,If you said everything you wanted, you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.55,0:40:30.85,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,We need to discuss personal matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.08,0:40:34.49,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I have something to tell you, so I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.22,0:40:39.12,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,-I'll come back.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.53,0:40:49.93,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I wanted to wait for your answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.93,0:40:51.90,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,but there is no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.94,0:40:55.61,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,From now on I will follow the distancing rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.61,0:40:57.78,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Why are you suddenly talking about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.78,0:41:00.61,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,If you don't want it, I'll be the one to follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.75,0:41:02.35,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.75,0:41:04.62,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.62,0:41:07.38,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,-Give me your hand.\N-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.92,0:41:09.69,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.10,0:41:25.90,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,My life
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.20,0:41:29.74,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,has always been in the hands of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.68,0:41:32.98,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Apparently this blinded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.21,0:41:38.38,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,And I couldn’t see that you\N are an innocent woman who
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.45,0:41:40.85,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,trying its best.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.09,0:41:44.15,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Sorry it's so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.19,0:41:47.76,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Give me one more chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.89,0:41:51.03,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Chance to understand you
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.23,0:41:55.63,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,as an individual without any prejudices.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.34,0:42:01.04,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,No need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.04,0:42:03.14,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I know you don’t like showing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.21,0:42:06.78,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,But I must sincerely apologize at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.78,0:42:07.98,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.98,0:42:09.98,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Okay. That's what we'll do. Distancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.98,0:42:12.15,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I have nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.59,0:42:19.06,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Then today is our first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.36,0:42:20.39,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.39,0:42:22.69,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,First day of distancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.13,0:42:25.43,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Don’t say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.43,0:42:28.27,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,-Why?\N-Just don’t say that. Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.47,0:42:30.57,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,What did I say wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.57,0:42:31.84,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Today is our first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.84,0:42:34.74,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Your f. She told me not to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.81,0:42:38.21,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,But I just said, today is our...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.21,0:42:40.44,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.98,0:42:43.28,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I bet you know what that means, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.28,0:42:45.32,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,But today is our first...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.32,0:42:47.52,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Stop it. How disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.52,0:42:48.85,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,-But this is our first day.\N-Stop already.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.85,0:42:50.92,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,-Our...\N-Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.29,0:42:54.96,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Then, since we’ve sorted this out,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.23,0:42:58.00,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,I will do everything to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.00,0:43:00.67,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Oh, exactly. There's no time to idle.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.67,0:43:02.40,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.03,0:43:05.84,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,Stop. Don't run like that. Don't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.07,0:43:08.77,Default,tiramisu,0,0,0,,You can get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.55,0:43:24.36,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.36,0:43:28.73,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,If the queen is unhappy, then you will be too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.96,0:43:31.93,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,-Is this a threat?\N-Just my concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.20,0:43:37.80,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,You are just her brother, but you are too protective.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.80,0:43:40.80,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,You are too indifferent, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.31,0:43:44.24,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I know I don't have much power,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.31,0:43:46.51,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,but some decency needs to be observed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.51,0:43:49.15,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,If you cross the line again,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.15,0:43:52.15,Default,singer,0,0,0,,I will raise the issue of your behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.32,0:43:55.45,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.36,0:43:59.52,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I'll make you write
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.86,0:44:03.43,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,very long letter of apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.56,0:44:08.33,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Just long.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.83,0:44:11.30,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,You may have to stay up all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.10,0:44:14.47,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,And your fingers will hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.59,0:44:31.52,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Do they really believe that she can be deposed?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.52,0:44:33.09,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Because of a simple request?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.09,0:44:36.63,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,They are trying to accumulate power with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.26,0:44:39.73,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,They will gather those who do not like our kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.73,0:44:42.53,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,and will increase the number of requests. Everything is obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.53,0:44:46.40,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,How dare they make their move so recklessly?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.40,0:44:48.74,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,We should have gone through this at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.74,0:44:50.84,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.84,0:44:53.54,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,the queen has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.98,0:44:56.71,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.17,0:45:20.60,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies for disturbing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.71,0:45:26.58,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I deserve to be stripped of my title.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.48,0:45:29.78,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,But even if so,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.91,0:45:32.65,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,the dowager queen must do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.65,0:45:37.29,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,It is wrong if someone from the Cho family does this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.99,0:45:41.29,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,No matter what kind of fool you are, no one will tolerate it,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.29,0:45:43.89,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,so that his subordinates \Nbe managed by someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.90,0:45:45.66,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,It's a matter of pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.66,0:45:48.53,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,If someone from the Cho family deprives me of my title,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.53,0:45:50.84,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,it will not be my defeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.84,0:45:53.54,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,this will be a defeat for the Kim family.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.41,0:45:56.41,Default,singer,0,0,0,,If you understand this,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.41,0:45:58.38,Default,singer,0,0,0,,how could she do what she needs to be responsible for?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.38,0:46:00.61,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,They rely on rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.61,0:46:02.08,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.08,0:46:03.11,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,And how?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.11,0:46:04.65,Default,singer,0,0,0,,The crisis is our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.65,0:46:07.25,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,If you give me some time,\NI'll use it,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.25,0:46:10.32,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,to change your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.23,0:46:22.83,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Today the king took your side,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.83,0:46:25.70,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,when I received the complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.64,0:46:28.67,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Idiot Cheoljong?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.57,0:46:31.64,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,What the queen did,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.64,0:46:34.65,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,not in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.55,0:46:41.42,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I must teach the Queen Mother a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.95,0:46:44.96,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I'll show her who's boss in this palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.96,0:46:53.00,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Are these all the palanquin bearers?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.83,0:46:54.83,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.83,0:46:56.63,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Choose again. Make sure they are funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.63,0:46:58.90,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty. Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.57,0:47:01.21,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.81,0:47:06.21,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Let them be tall and with a good figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.21,0:47:08.18,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,The stump is clear, and the young.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.25,0:47:14.59,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Are you really choosing porters?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.79,0:47:17.79,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I choose not just palanquin bearers.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.06,0:47:20.06,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,You'll be amazed when you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.73,0:47:24.19,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I choose...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.64,0:47:35.74,Default,zinger,0,0,0,, -By the way. Have you heard gossip?\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.74,0:47:38.34,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,The Queen didn’t try to kill herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.34,0:47:40.94,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,She wanted to save the king and his concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.21,0:47:45.38,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I wanted to save the king and his concubine,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.38,0:47:47.72,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,that’s why she lied and said it was suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.72,0:47:49.15,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.15,0:47:50.89,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,-Family...\N-Or husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.89,0:47:52.62,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,-That’s what...\N-Question.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.62,0:47:56.16,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,And in the end she lost the trust of the dowager queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.16,0:47:59.26,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,And she puts a silver knife to her neck and says:
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.26,0:48:02.03,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,"I will escape from this unfortunate fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.03,0:48:04.17,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,where I can’t choose a side.”
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.47,0:48:07.51,Default,singer,0,0,0,,That’s what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.51,0:48:09.54,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,She was a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.54,0:48:12.91,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Rumor has it that she went to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.64,0:48:15.71,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Because you fell into the lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.85,0:48:19.92,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,And when I met the Jade Emperor, I turned into a fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.02,0:48:29.09,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.09,0:48:31.63,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I’m not just choosing porters,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.63,0:48:33.10,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I choose storytellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.10,0:48:37.30,Default,singer,0,0,0,,Live tabloids that will spread rumors like an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.74,0:48:39.04,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.04,0:48:42.34,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,When rumors start spreading,\N it turns into an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.34,0:48:45.51,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,They scatter so much that even the one who started it all is unable to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.51,0:48:48.55,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,And they spread in an unexpected way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.55,0:48:50.48,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,If she didn't try to commit suicide,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.48,0:48:54.08,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,so the one who pushed her into the lake...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.15,0:48:58.16,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,That is, the queen risked her life to
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.16,0:49:00.52,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,save the concubine who tried to kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.73,0:49:03.59,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Mommies.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.97,0:49:10.10,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Somehow I suddenly felt chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.34,0:49:13.97,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,It’s time for you to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.21,0:49:16.21,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,This won’t work. I'll carry you if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.21,0:49:18.88,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Come on. Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.88,0:49:22.01,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi doesn't grumble at me, so now you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.01,0:49:24.58,Default,singer,0,0,0,,Some kind of conservation law for grumbling, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.78,0:49:29.32,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,By the way, I haven’t seen her for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.39,0:49:31.52,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,What a dunce.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.02,0:49:35.86,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Can you give me a big hug? Cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.00,0:50:15.73,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.73,0:50:18.34,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,How could you harm yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.34,0:50:21.77,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Do you want me to go crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.77,0:50:25.28,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,How could you arrange a swim with the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.28,0:50:28.41,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Do you want to put the country in a dangerous situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.41,0:50:30.48,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Talisman? Ritual?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.48,0:50:33.92,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t get involved in such prejudices.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.92,0:50:37.82,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,And you can’t say that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.82,0:50:40.76,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,From first to last,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.76,0:50:45.73,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,none of this is allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.11,0:51:00.81,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Somehow I didn’t feel any better after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.81,0:51:04.78,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,If I grumble at her, Her Majesty will be restless.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.45,0:51:09.75,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,If I don’t, then I’m restless.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.32,0:51:15.29,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,So what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.60,0:51:27.00,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.14,0:51:30.04,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,-Have you heard the rumors? \N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.04,0:51:32.44,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,This is all they whisper about in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.44,0:51:35.25,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,They say the queen risked her life,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.25,0:51:37.58,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,to save you, who tried to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.72,0:51:39.62,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Who could say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.18,0:51:42.22,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,And not the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.35,0:51:44.89,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Changed by rumors that she is a local witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.89,0:51:47.22,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,that she is a Buddha, a fairy, a virtuous woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.22,0:51:50.36,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,She managed to change everyone’s mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.80,0:51:56.17,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Now they will curse you and say that you are immoral.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.57,0:52:00.70,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,She had this plan from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.70,0:52:04.18,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,She came to me in the Sononjong hall and threatened me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.18,0:52:06.01,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,So that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.38,0:52:09.98,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I will go to the king and tell him,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.98,0:52:13.42,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,so that the queen could no longer deceive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.82,0:52:15.55,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.15,0:52:20.12,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Will he believe your words?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.36,0:52:23.46,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,The king will believe what I tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.46,0:52:27.70,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,He rejected the request to depose the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.07,0:52:35.81,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,The royal concubine has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.34,0:52:42.01,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.45,0:52:47.35,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I was just about to see you,\Nwe need to talk about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.95,0:52:50.45,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.45,0:52:52.62,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Today at the council
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.62,0:52:55.89,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I have received a petition to depose the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.06,0:52:58.46,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.46,0:53:01.63,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,The Queen put herself in danger to save us,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.63,0:53:04.37,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,I thought it was wrong to stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.60,0:53:09.24,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,So I want to ask the royal secretariat to recall it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.27,0:53:11.04,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.48,0:53:14.11,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,Do you want me to ask my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.11,0:53:18.35,Default,zinger,0,0,0,,He is very respected, many follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.39,0:53:23.49,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Or is my request too complicated?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.72,0:53:28.06,Default,Only,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.06,0:53:31.70,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I’ll notify my father myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.26,0:53:33.46,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.46,0:53:35.13,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.13,0:53:39.04,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,When I came here, I always wanted only one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.27,0:53:42.21,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,To be your support, as in our first meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.21,0:53:44.67,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,So that next to me you can
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.98,0:53:48.01,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,forget all your fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.61,0:53:52.72,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,You are already a great comfort to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.98,0:53:56.12,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,However, we are still
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.82,0:53:59.49,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,we haven’t spent a single night together.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.26,0:54:06.63,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,It was my fault that you felt lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.96,0:54:09.13,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I understand everything, you were busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.13,0:54:11.27,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,The demon misled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.80,0:54:13.94,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Wait for me in your chambers this night.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.57,0:54:17.34,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,But tomorrow night you were supposed to
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.34,0:54:19.31,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,spend with Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.68,0:54:21.85,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,This is not your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.55,0:54:24.98,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Then I will visit the queen and cheer her up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.98,0:54:27.12,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,And then I’ll immediately sit down to write to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.12,0:54:29.05,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,That would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.23,0:54:39.53,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Concubine Cho came to visit Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.53,0:54:41.70,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,My apologies, Her Majesty was unwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.70,0:54:43.80,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,so she drank a medicinal decoction
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.80,0:54:46.07,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,and fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.70,0:54:48.37,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.41,0:54:50.14,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Well, I'll come another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.89,0:55:04.55,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Have you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.92,0:55:08.69,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,You were just sleeping like a baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.10,0:55:16.87,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,And they told me that you are not feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.17,0:55:21.81,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I can’t boast of feeling well yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.81,0:55:25.94,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,however, I don’t regret anything. Joseon needed a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.61,0:55:29.48,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,-Hero? \N-Why are we standing at the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.48,0:55:31.35,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.76,0:55:42.29,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Leave us alone so we...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.29,0:55:45.70,Default,Only,0,0,0,,So that we can talk in a calm atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.74,0:56:02.65,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.32,0:56:15.59,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Why are you sitting so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.16,0:56:18.66,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,As if not native.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.06,0:56:20.90,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,You should move closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.90,0:56:22.63,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I feel good here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.03,0:56:27.87,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Then I’ll sit closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.87,0:56:30.14,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I appeared as a prince on a white horse and saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.14,0:56:33.28,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Finally, her unkind gaze\N will be filled with love and adoration.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.41,0:56:38.21,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,What? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.88,0:56:40.15,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Your view has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.15,0:56:43.42,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,But why is he even colder than before?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.89,0:56:46.69,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I will ask my father to pick up the petition.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.42,0:56:50.93,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,So we will be even.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.33,0:56:54.06,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.06,0:56:58.47,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,You probably think that everything is going your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.04,0:57:00.64,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,What are you, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.64,0:57:02.71,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I don’t think anything works here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.71,0:57:04.88,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,We decided to return the location in this way
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.88,0:57:06.84,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,His Majesty after all your lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.84,0:57:08.58,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.58,0:57:12.05,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Of course, I’m not one of the most honest,\N but I don’t stoop to lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.38,0:57:14.62,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,I knew that you would make yourself look like a simpleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.62,0:57:17.19,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,What? I'm not building anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.76,0:57:21.79,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I have already repeated it many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.79,0:57:25.50,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,The king doesn’t interest me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.56,0:57:28.23,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.47,0:57:31.27,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,This time I will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.84,0:57:35.71,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Maybe you can stay the night\Nto get even closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.71,0:57:37.14,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,We'll have a pajama party.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.14,0:57:40.18,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,That is, a party in underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.18,0:57:44.31,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I will spend this night with His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.42,0:57:47.05,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,How so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.55,0:57:49.35,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,And so you break your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.62,0:57:52.49,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,so you also came to tell me this personally?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.49,0:57:55.96,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Just like that right away? Heartless?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.69,0:57:59.86,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Somehow you are painfully upset for someone who is not interested in the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.86,0:58:01.43,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I’m not interested in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.43,0:58:04.17,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,But I didn’t say anything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.30,0:58:07.40,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,So prove that your affection for me is sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.40,0:58:11.34,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,If your actions again diverge from your words,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.51,0:58:15.48,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,blame yourself. You won't find it enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.92,0:58:21.32,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Since you are so determined, I wash my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.49,0:58:24.15,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.25,0:58:28.36,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,I surrender, my blessing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.53,0:58:30.36,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,But you have no idea what you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.36,0:58:32.80,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,I didn’t notice happiness under my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.63,0:58:35.27,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.18,0:58:48.51,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,This is a tough nut to crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.68,0:58:53.15,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,What a cruel woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.27,0:59:13.07,Default,Toll,0,0,0,,15, 20...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.04,0:59:20.01,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Own what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.55,0:59:25.01,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,My heart is heavy, I am sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.55,0:59:28.09,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,I came here to heal my wounded heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.09,0:59:31.09,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,You've come to the wrong address.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.09,0:59:34.12,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,We trade a lot of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.12,0:59:36.33,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,but we don’t have any drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.33,0:59:38.26,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I ask you, we are closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.26,0:59:40.30,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Come on, the exit is over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.03,0:59:43.37,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,-But I...\N-Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.37,0:59:47.37,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,I would like that miraculous thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.67,0:59:49.31,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.84,0:59:54.71,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,The same one that was brought from the Qing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.99,1:00:38.39,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I called you to discuss the topic,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.39,1:00:40.82,Default,Only,0,0,0,,that was raised at today's meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.12,1:00:43.43,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Dare to secretly discuss the deposition of the queen?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.43,1:00:46.36,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,By this you insult the entire family of Kims from Andon!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.36,1:00:48.53,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,In the courtyard where the queen is
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.53,1:00:51.10,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,may decide to drown himself at any moment,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.10,1:00:53.74,Default,Only,0,0,0,,there will be no stability!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.57,1:00:56.84,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,How dare you speak ill of Her Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.97,1:00:59.44,Default,Only,0,0,0,,You only know how to spit poison!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.44,1:01:01.41,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Spit poison?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.88,1:01:06.45,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I will not tolerate such an insult.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.36,1:01:19.40,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.40,1:01:21.60,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Are you planning something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.81,1:01:32.04,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,What are you, I just ask you to listen to the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.04,1:01:33.71,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Shelmets.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.02,1:01:49.63,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,As I already said, none of you\N lose anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.66,1:01:53.30,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Why not stick around\N and listen to the end?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.70,1:01:58.43,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.18,1:02:17.15,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I don’t know if you remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.15,1:02:21.56,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,The letter that the Queen Mother wrote.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.56,1:02:25.00,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Place, date and time specified in it,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.00,1:02:28.43,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,coincide with when and where\Nthe accident with the queen occurred.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.93,1:02:31.07,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,That letter was falsified.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.07,1:02:34.00,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,But can you prove it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.48,1:02:41.18,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I suggest you come to your senses and not overthrow the queen,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.35,1:02:45.45,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,in return you will receive this message.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.72,1:02:48.15,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Thus to your families
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.15,1:02:50.92,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,no longer have to fear the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.92,1:02:53.72,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,This is my proposal.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.93,1:02:57.76,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,How do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.61,1:03:18.31,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Did you call?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.08,1:03:22.42,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I fulfilled His Majesty's request\N and wrote to my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.85,1:03:25.79,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Will you deliver my message to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.36,1:03:29.96,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I'll try
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.46,1:03:32.30,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,convince His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.30,1:03:36.80,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,His Majesty just wants\N to repay kindness for kindness.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.20,1:03:39.80,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Although Her Majesty has a different opinion on this matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.47,1:03:44.51,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,But I only care about the feelings of His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.94,1:03:48.88,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Therefore everything is in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.81,1:03:53.72,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Your Highness, everything is ready for swimming.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.97,1:04:21.94,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Everything is fine for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.12,1:04:31.92,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.99,1:04:34.32,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Are you doing well?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.32,1:04:38.76,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Would I call you if everything was fine with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.63,1:04:45.27,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,My heart is anxious and restless.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.47,1:04:48.50,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.01,1:04:52.21,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I will help you find the answer to your question.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.70,1:05:19.77,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,His Majesty was just going to see Concubine Cho.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.77,1:05:21.87,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I have a conversation with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.31,1:05:24.51,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.61,1:05:27.28,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.05,1:05:37.25,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,The deposition of the queen will help accomplish the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.25,1:05:40.06,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,So why are you so opposed to this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.06,1:05:41.59,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,They will depose one queen,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.59,1:05:44.13,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,another will immediately take her place.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.36,1:05:47.30,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,As long as the queen’s actions do not interfere with us, but vice versa.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.30,1:05:49.17,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,She is the best option
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.17,1:05:51.60,Default,Only,0,0,0,,of all possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.57,1:05:54.57,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Did she touch your heart?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.21,1:06:01.98,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Answer. Is that why you hesitate?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.25,1:06:03.91,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.35,1:06:06.22,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Touched.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.72,1:06:09.99,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I attempted on her life,\Nshe wanted to sacrifice hers,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.99,1:06:12.46,Default,Only,0,0,0,,to save me and the one I love.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.46,1:06:13.72,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Not out of compassion
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.72,1:06:14.99,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,and not because I forgave,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.99,1:06:17.89,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,but because he cannot tolerate injustice.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.89,1:06:21.00,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,She doesn’t expect an apology or gratitude from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.00,1:06:23.67,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Simply acts according to his conscience.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.67,1:06:26.04,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Now everyone has turned their backs on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.67,1:06:29.57,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Can I do the same?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.97,1:06:32.51,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,It turns out that you will renounce us
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.58,1:06:37.15,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,and from your concubine?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.18,1:06:41.92,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I feel nothing for Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.12,1:06:44.42,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,But she is not our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.42,1:06:47.56,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,I do not renounce you and do not betray you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.56,1:06:50.33,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,It will be bad if you have feelings for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.33,1:06:52.26,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Attached to her,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.26,1:06:54.76,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,you will put us all at risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.76,1:06:57.13,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I will try to prevent this from happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.40,1:06:59.20,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.70,1:07:02.07,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Then promise me this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.24,1:07:05.14,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Promise that if the queen
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.14,1:07:09.11,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,will interfere with our plans
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.85,1:07:12.01,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,or behave strangely,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.25,1:07:15.15,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,you without hesitation
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.42,1:07:19.66,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,order her to be killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.51,1:07:46.58,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Why don’t you answer?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.58,1:07:48.62,Default,Only,0,0,0,,If the queen
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.89,1:07:52.96,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,suddenly begins to interfere with our plans,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.96,1:08:00.93,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I will personally behead her.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.31,1:08:17.55,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Wow, I’m getting better and better every time.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.68,1:08:22.32,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Did you really embroider this yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.32,1:08:24.49,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,That’s right, little flowers. Is there any in Joseon?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.49,1:08:26.46,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,someone who doesn’t know how to embroider?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.46,1:08:28.22,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Descendants of the land of morning freshness
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.22,1:08:29.86,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I see there is.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.89,1:08:34.40,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,And not everyone should be able to embroider.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.83,1:08:37.50,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Hardy, and you can do everything in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.50,1:08:41.17,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,What are you saying, I’m the worst of the court ladies.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.37,1:08:45.01,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Everyone says that I’m like a violet.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.84,1:08:49.88,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Yeah, everyone here is so handy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.95,1:08:51.75,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Well, let's look at our creativity.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.78,1:08:54.42,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Straighten.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.19,1:09:01.46,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Descendants of the land of morning freshness\NOpening of delivery
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.62,1:09:04.39,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Let's hang this in front of the stable.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.39,1:09:07.03,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I feel like things are going great for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.76,1:09:08.87,Default,Only,0,0,0,,How much should I take?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.87,1:09:11.17,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,To get to Oktaejeon, you need money.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.17,1:09:12.80,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.20,1:09:17.04,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,I brought you a flower. Rare orchid of the winds.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.04,1:09:18.74,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Orchid of the winds?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.71,1:09:21.95,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Has there already been word of mouth about our delivery?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.95,1:09:24.41,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,From whom are the flowers?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.15,1:09:28.35,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Socially distancing, but congratulations
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.55,1:09:31.92,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,From His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.69,1:09:37.93,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Why are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.09,1:09:39.76,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,What a bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.76,1:09:42.37,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I’m trying to forget myself, I’m immersed in work.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.37,1:09:44.53,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,What is this guy doing? What kind of show is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.87,1:09:47.87,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Yes, I’m a thousand times cooler.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.87,1:09:50.07,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Judge for yourself. That's what I came up with!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.07,1:09:52.18,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,I am creating jobs. What is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.18,1:09:55.14,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,And this is all at a time when there are no round-the-clock services.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.21,1:09:57.81,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Yes, I’m a genius, a genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.08,1:10:02.69,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Am I scaring her away with my coolness?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.85,1:10:05.29,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Well, yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.36,1:10:07.16,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.02,1:10:11.06,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,This is because of outrageous speeches
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.06,1:10:15.97,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,it turns out to be one nasty thing? \NWhy doesn't anything good come of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.33,1:10:18.23,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.60,1:10:22.40,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Since people here are dark and there are no amenities,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.61,1:10:25.28,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,with my ideas I can go down in the history of Joseon!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.28,1:10:28.68,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,No, global!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.68,1:11:06.68,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I was really motivated.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.82,1:11:09.52,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Can I become the local \NSteve Jobs or Thomas Edison?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.52,1:11:13.32,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,No, I'm taking it low. We need someone great.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.32,1:11:16.86,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Savior of the human race.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.97,1:11:31.57,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,In the queen’s body sits,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.68,1:11:36.38,Default,Only,0,0,0,,which should not be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.98,1:11:38.98,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Evil spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.55,1:11:45.02,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,The Queen is possessed by an evil spirit!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.56,1:11:50.43,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,We need to drive out this spirit!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.49,1:11:53.56,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Or else the whole world...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.83,1:12:00.57,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,The whole world will turn upside down!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.94,1:12:05.57,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Exactly, Carrier!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.64,1:12:07.81,Default,Tolya,0,0,0,,Inventor of air conditioners!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.22,1:12:15.25,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.25,1:12:17.69,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Come to your senses, Your Majesty! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.69,1:12:19.29,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.36,1:12:21.56,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.86,1:12:29.47,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,She... She's not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.81,1:12:38.74,Default,Only,0,0,0,,And I don’t feel the pulsations.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.44,1:13:15.68,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,The Queen is now unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.68,1:13:17.65,Default,Toly,0,0,0,,You say the queen is lying lifeless?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.65,1:13:20.48,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,To save her, you need to start\N the flow of male chi energy. Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.48,1:13:22.62,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Hospital? Am I back?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.62,1:13:24.52,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,I will show that the king
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.52,1:13:26.42,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,is what it really is.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.42,1:13:30.76,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,This man is two-faced to the core.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.76,1:13:32.86,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Move away. Discharge!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.03,1:13:38.20,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,-Queen. \N-I order you to find out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.20,1:13:39.84,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,Not a step further.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.84,1:13:41.97,Default,Tol,0,0,0,,This is my woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,


